    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "712d6a8bec159d08",
      "translationZh": "90K，34 tok/s（运行 16 次）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "63527cd11295b0d3",
      "translationZh": "前言：我使用的是 WSL2。通过 llama.cpp 运行 27B Q5 UD GGUF，使用 81,920 的上下文长度并启用 MTP，速度大约为 25-30 tok/s。然后我发现了这个 GitHub 仓库：https://github.com/noonghunna/club-3090",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6ec202a82e7160cc",
      "translationZh": "它基本上就是一套用于运行该模型的操作方案和 Docker 配置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "30dea0c3594b513b",
      "translationZh": "所以，30 tok/s 本身还可以，但等 RunPod 开放 GPU 实在让我等烦了。我终于重新捡起了之前搁置的 vLLM 调优，于是就有了这篇文章。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9dc285a00b9a93cb",
      "translationZh": "我经常忘记，Inductor/Triton 编译和 CUDA Graph 捕获在测试配置和内核调用时需要额外的显存。以前 JIT 编译因 OOM 失败时，我从来没费心试过 AOT。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5eea1e75a7fce33e",
      "translationZh": "顺便说明一下，AOT 和 JIT 都是编译策略。AOT 指 Ahead of Time（提前编译），而 JIT 指 Just in Time（即时编译）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9aed2ca9dbff5bc7",
      "translationZh": "如果首次启动时遇到 OOM，就再试一次。Inductor 可能在 OOM 之前已经编译并缓存了部分配置，只要配置没有变化，下次运行就能复用这些内容。这不能保证一定有效，但对我来说管用了。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "004dcbad427c63a9",
      "translationZh": "没错，这就是不断试错的过程。有点枯燥，而且真他妈折腾：从 32K 开始，然后是 64K、80K、128K，最后到 144K。我这套配置的实际极限是 154K，但我选择了 144K。我还把批大小从 256 开始一路提高到 1024，不过也许还能挤到 1280-1536。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d6036be3c63c31be",
      "translationZh": "另外，要留意你的 vLLM 编译缓存。测试过许多配置后，它可能会增长到 5-6GB。我个人会删除旧缓存，然后用最终配置再运行两次，这样它就只会重新构建我当前使用的内容。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2956d5fff07943a6",
      "translationZh": "我目前的配置通过 vLLM 运行采用 INT4 AutoRound 权重的 Qwen3.8-27B，同时使用 FP8 E4M3 KV 缓存。在上下文窗口配置为 147,456 tokens 的情况下，单张 GPU 就能容纳。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "71ac2f4d40f21e06",
      "translationZh": "不过我得说，对于 GDN，或者其实任何 linear-attn，vLLM 在预测 KV 和状态缓存池需要多少 VRAM 时，可能都不太准。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "67cbe125857987ae",
      "translationZh": "这是 BenchLocal 中采用确定性评分、无需 Docker 的部分：75 个场景，涵盖工具调用、指令遵循、结构化输出、数据提取以及推理/数学。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0b22251a5cf7afea",
      "translationZh": "通过 reasoning_effort=low 强制开启了思考。运行耗时约 15 分钟。没错，即使推理强度设为低、权重采用 INT4，它也通过了 71/75。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "734d2c856530032e",
      "translationZh": "GPU：RTX 3090 245W，24GB，48G RAM DDR4（从 WSL2 暴露出来），E5 2690V4",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fdc93f5d7016a8ee",
      "translationZh": "模型：https://huggingface.co/Avuja/Qwen3.8-27B-int4-AutoRound",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9d77075656c37a10",
      "translationZh": "推理引擎：vLLM 0.27.1，使用了来自 Club 3090 的补丁",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "707b0e6f69a1c01f",
      "translationZh": "重要的 vLLM 设置如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "38be767e431dc7f1",
      "translationZh": "--gpu-memory-utilization 0.9475（这个参数重新调起来很痛苦。）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "88db8deaa9db9457",
      "translationZh": "--max-num-seqs 1（没错，一次只能处理一个请求，你可以把它改成 2，但 KV 容量就会被分摊，毕竟活跃请求得共享同一份 KV 总容量。）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c7eb6a84b181190a",
      "translationZh": "--max-num-batched-tokens 1024（预填充相关 / 提示词处理）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2b228475957b4bc9",
      "translationZh": "--long-prefill-token-threshold 1024（预填充相关 / 提示词处理）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d4acf2c06918b1c3",
      "translationZh": "--mamba-cache-mode align（GDN 相关设置）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "35d6835daa612038",
      "translationZh": "完整命令：https://gist.github.com/komikndr/b17955e1a80ce6ede9a3115f16216bc5#vllm-qwen-27b-38-just-remove-or-add-flag-as-you-like",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "82afbe900a63298f",
      "translationZh": "忘了说，没有启用 MTP，也没有启用 MultiModal，我把 CTX 开到了最大；多模态下大约能到 64-65K，但到了那个程度，我就直接用 Llamacpp 了。另外再说一次，这是在 WSL2 上运行的，如果你是在裸机上运行，还能进一步提高速度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "04427f86651e1015",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/Altruistic_Heat_9531 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
